> But that's all speculation.  Does -mieee lead to any performance loss?

I tested the server (XF86_TGA) built with and without -mieee using
x11perf.  The full results are rather too big to post here (~300
lines).  Briefly:

Normal X beat -miee 160 times
-miee beat normal X 121 times
Both servers tied 51 times

This either proves that x11perf is no longer a valid benchmark for X
servers, or that the servers have approximately the same performance.
I think it is the latter.

