Samsung AlphaPC 164UX motherboard is actually DeskStation RPX164-2.
In order to install RedHat Linux 5.0,

1. Put the PCI graphic card in 64-bit PCI slot

2. Use rawrite.exe to create MILO disk from
   ftp://gatekeeper.dec.com/pub/DEC/Linux-Alpha/Kernels/Test-Milos-
2.0.30+/ruffian.img

3. Use rawrite.exe to create Bootdisk from
   ftp://www.deskstation.com/linux/install/ruffboot.img

4. Use rawrite.exe to create Ramdisk from ramdisk.img on
   RedHat Linux 5.0 distribution

Good luck.

